; DNS for AI Discovery (DNS-AID) records for ui-skills.com
; Spec: draft-mozleywilliams-dnsop-dnsaid + RFC 9460 (SVCB/HTTPS)
;
; Publish with: CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=... ./scripts/publish-dns-aid.sh
; Optionally enable DNSSEC: ENABLE_DNSSEC=1 CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=... ./scripts/publish-dns-aid.sh
;
; ServiceMode HTTPS records (priority >= 1) with alpn + port.
; Target the canonical site host (www.ui-skills.com).
; MCP/A2A labels are omitted until those endpoints exist.

_index._agents.ui-skills.com.      3600 IN HTTPS 1 www.ui-skills.com. alpn="h3,h2" port=443
_index._agents.www.ui-skills.com.  3600 IN HTTPS 1 www.ui-skills.com. alpn="h3,h2" port=443
